flowchart LR
    U[User / Browser] --> FE[React Frontend]
    FE --> API[FastAPI API]
    API --> CTX[Request Context]
    API --> AUTH[JWT/JWKS Authentication]
    AUTH --> AUTHZ[RBAC + ABAC]
    API --> ORCH[LangGraph Orchestrator]
    ORCH --> GW[Secure Tool Gateway]
    GW --> FILE[File Service]
    FILE --> DOC[Document Parsers]
    DOC --> RET[Retrieval Service]
    GW --> DB[Database Service]
    GW --> MAIL[Email Service]
    GW --> REP[Report Service]
    RET --> SRC[Source Reference Service]
    DB --> SRC
    MAIL --> SRC
    REP --> SRC
    AUTHZ --> AUD[Audit Logger]
    GW --> AUD
    API --> OBS[Structured Logs / Optional OTel]
    ORCH --> OBS
    GW --> OBS
    DB --> OBS
    MAIL --> OBS
    FILE --> OBS
    RET --> OBS
    REP --> OBS
    JOB[Redis Queue / Worker Contract] --> OBS
